# A new trigger in the scenario editor: the event list scrolled by dragging
# its scroll bar and by its arrow, a name typed into the edit box, and the
# trigger, which fires when the player enters a cell, put on two cells of the
# map with the mouse. Esc ends the placing.
# args: -EDITOR
at 201 rclick 400 150
at 241 key DOWN
at 245 key DOWN
at 249 key DOWN
at 253 key DOWN
at 257 key DOWN
at 261 key DOWN
at 271 key RETURN
at 311 click 145 169
at 370 shot trigger_list
at 371 click 240 321
at 420 shot trigger_editor
at 421 press 301 110
at 425 move 301 130
at 430 move 303 150
at 440 shot events_dragging
at 441 release 303 150
at 460 shot events_scrolled
at 461 click 301 91
at 480 shot events_up_one_line
at 481 click 220 194
at 491 type GATE
at 510 shot named
at 511 click 265 365
at 560 shot list_with_the_trigger
at 561 click 560 321
at 600 shot placing
# A click on the map has to last: the editor asks whether the button is still
# down when it gets to the click.
at 601 press 460 300
at 605 release 460 300
at 620 shot on_one_cell
at 621 press 512 370
at 625 release 512 370
at 640 shot on_two_cells
at 641 key ESC
at 660 shot placing_ended
at 661 quit
